      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "```None\n                Currently unused.\n```",
      "contextAfter": "For independently decodable packets, the [`mPreRollCount`](audiostreampacketdependencydescription/mprerollcount.md) indicates how many additional packets need to be decoded after this packet in order for the decoder to start returning optimal output, if this is the first packet decoded since the decoder was initialized.",
